whisper: Hop! A small platformer. Left and right run, space jumps.
whisper: Pick up every coin, then touch the flag at the far end.

use: window
use: maths

a platform has:
  x (a number)
  y (a number)
  width (a number)
  height (a number)
and the universe said i love you

a coin has:
  birth (a flat place)
  taken (yes or no)
and the universe said i love you

the world remembers:
  player x (a number)
  player y (a number)
  speed x (a number)
  speed y (a number)
  on ground (yes or no)
  facing (a number)
  platforms (a list of platforms)
  coins (a list of coins)
  score (a number)
  camera (a number)
  ticks (a number)
  won (yes or no)
and the universe said i love you

whisper: ---- making the level

to platform at, given x (a number) and y (a number) and width (a number) and height (a number), returning a platform:
  conjure a platform as made
  set the x of made to x
  set the y of made to y
  set the width of made to width
  set the height of made to height
  return made
and the universe said i love you

to coin at, given x (a number) and y (a number), returning a coin:
  conjure a coin as made
  set the birth of made to x horizontal y vertical
  return made
and the universe said i love you

to build the level:
  add platform at with (0, 460, 760, 80) to platforms
  add platform at with (880, 460, 720, 80) to platforms
  add platform at with (1720, 460, 300, 80) to platforms
  add platform at with (2160, 460, 1040, 80) to platforms
  add platform at with (330, 360, 160, 24) to platforms
  add platform at with (1180, 340, 140, 24) to platforms
  add platform at with (1400, 250, 140, 24) to platforms
  add platform at with (1840, 330, 120, 24) to platforms
  add platform at with (2400, 380, 60, 80) to platforms
  add platform at with (2640, 330, 60, 130) to platforms
  add coin at with (410, 320) to coins
  add coin at with (820, 380) to coins
  add coin at with (1250, 300) to coins
  add coin at with (1470, 210) to coins
  add coin at with (1900, 290) to coins
  add coin at with (2430, 340) to coins
  add coin at with (2670, 290) to coins
and the universe said i love you

whisper: ---- moving the player: speed changes the place, gravity changes the speed

to run and jump:
  if key held "left":
    set speed x to speed x minus 0.8
    set facing to -1
  otherwise if key held "right":
    set speed x to speed x plus 0.8
    set facing to 1
  otherwise:
    set speed x to speed x times 0.8
  set speed x to clamp speed x between -6 and 6
  if key pressed "space" and on ground:
    set speed y to -13
  set speed y to smaller of (speed y plus 0.6) and 14
and the universe said i love you

to overlaps, given p (a platform), returning yes or no:
  return player x plus 30 exceeds the x of p and player x falls below the x of p plus the width of p and player y plus 40 exceeds the y of p and player y falls below the y of p plus the height of p
and the universe said i love you

to move across:
  set player x to player x plus speed x
  for each p in platforms:
    if overlaps with p:
      if speed x exceeds 0: set player x to the x of p minus 30
      otherwise: set player x to the x of p plus the width of p
      set speed x to 0
  set player x to clamp player x between 0 and 3170
and the universe said i love you

to move up and down:
  set on ground to no
  set player y to player y plus speed y
  for each p in platforms:
    if overlaps with p:
      if speed y exceeds 0:
        set player y to the y of p minus 40
        set on ground to yes
      otherwise:
        set player y to the y of p plus the height of p
      set speed y to 0
and the universe said i love you

to pick up coins:
  set middle to (player x plus 15) horizontal (player y plus 20) vertical
  for each n from 1 to the size of coins:
    if not the taken of item n of coins and the existence of item n of coins is within 30 of middle:
      set the taken of item n of coins to yes
      set score to score plus 1
and the universe said i love you

to start again:
  set player x to 60
  set player y to 400
  set speed x to 0
  set speed y to 0
and the universe said i love you

whisper: ---- drawing: the camera follows the player, and everything is etched where the camera sees it

to etch the sky:
  consume the window with "#8fd3ff"
  for each n from 0 to 6:
    set hill x to n times 520 minus remainder of (camera times 0.3, 520)
    etch a circle with hill x, 560, 260, "#7fc8a9"
  for each n from 0 to 8:
    set cloud x to n times 400 minus remainder of (camera times 0.15, 400)
    etch a circle with cloud x, 90 plus (remainder of (n, 3)) times 25, 26, "white"
    etch a circle with cloud x plus 30, 80 plus (remainder of (n, 3)) times 25, 32, "white"
    etch a circle with cloud x plus 62, 92 plus (remainder of (n, 3)) times 25, 24, "white"
and the universe said i love you

to etch the level:
  for each p in platforms:
    set left to the x of p minus camera
    etch a box with left, the y of p, the width of p, the height of p, "#8a5a33"
    etch a box with left, the y of p, the width of p, 10, "#4caf50"
  for each c in coins:
    if not the taken of c:
      set bob to sine of (ticks times 4 plus (the existence of c of horizontal)) times 4
      etch a circle with (the existence of c of horizontal) minus camera, (the existence of c of vertical) plus bob, 11, "#ffc107"
      etch a circle with (the existence of c of horizontal) minus camera minus 3, (the existence of c of vertical) plus bob minus 3, 4, "#fff3c4"
  etch a box with 3060 minus camera, 300, 6, 160, "#5d4037"
  set flag colour to "#e53935"
  if score is the size of coins: set flag colour to "#43a047"
  etch a box with 3066 minus camera, 300, 46, 30, flag colour
and the universe said i love you

to etch the player:
  set left to player x minus camera
  set squash to 0
  if not on ground: set squash to 4
  etch a box with left, player y plus squash, 30, 40 minus squash, "#3f51b5"
  set eye x to left plus 15 plus facing times 6
  etch a circle with eye x minus 5, player y plus 14, 4, "white"
  etch a circle with eye x plus 5, player y plus 14, 4, "white"
  etch a circle with eye x minus 5 plus facing, player y plus 14, 2, "black"
  etch a circle with eye x plus 5 plus facing, player y plus 14, 2, "black"
and the universe said i love you

to etch the score:
  set the text size to 26
  etch words with "Coins: [score] of [the size of coins]", 22, 18, "#1b2a49"
  if won:
    set the text size to 64
    etch words with "You win!", 340, 180, "#1b2a49"
and the universe said i love you

genesis:
  open a world with "Hop!", 960, 540
  build the level
  start again
  set facing to 1
  as long as the world lives:
    if not won:
      run and jump
      move across
      move up and down
      pick up coins
      if player y exceeds 700: start again
      if score is the size of coins and player x exceeds 3030: set won to yes
    set camera to clamp (player x minus 360) between 0 and 2240
    set ticks to ticks plus frame time
    etch the sky
    etch the level
    etch the player
    etch the score
    reveal the frame
and the universe said i love you
